        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"ms\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Kesihatan Mental Pelajar Universiti - Nota Kosa Kata</title>\n<script src=\"https://polyfill.io/v3/polyfill.min.js?features=es6\"></script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    background: #cfcfc4;\n    font-family: Georgia, \"Times New Roman\", serif;\n    color: #1a1a1a;\n  }\n  .page {\n    position: relative;\n    width: 540px;\n    min-height: 720px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    background: #cfcfc4;\n  }\n  /* top bar area */\n  .topbar {\n    height: 78px;\n    position: relative;\n  }\n  .page-num {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 8px;\n    left: 8px;\n    width: 22px;\n    height: 22px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: #bdbdb2;\n    color: #4a4a44;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    text-align: center;\n    line-height: 22px;\n  }\n  .top-placeholder {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 18px;\n    left: 34px;\n    width: 476px;\n    height: 52px;\n    background: #c4c4b8;\n    border: 1px solid #b5b5aa;\n    font-size: 9px;\n    color: #8a8a80;\n    text-align: center;\n    line-height: 52px;\n  }\n  /* main two-column zone */\n  .columns {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    padding: 0 0 0 34px;\n  }\n  .col-main {\n    width: 315px;\n    padding-right: 14px;\n    border-right: 1px solid #a9a99e;\n    font-size: 15.5px;\n    line-height: 1.55;\n  }\n  .col-main p { margin: 0 0 14px 0; }\n  .col-notes {\n    width: 118px;\n    padding: 14px 6px 0 10px;\n    font-family: \"Comic Sans MS\", \"Segoe Print\", cursive;\n    font-size: 12.5px;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n    color: #e8478f;\n  }\n  .col-notes p { margin: 0 0 20px 0; }\n  /* highlight styles */\n  .hl { background: #d9a9c9; padding: 0 2px; border-radius: 2px; }\n  .hl2 { background: #c9a9cf; padding: 0 2px; border-radius: 2px; }\n  /* right side menu strip */\n  .menu-strip {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 78px;\n    right: 0;\n    width: 30px;\n  }\n  .menu-tab {\n    background: #d7d7cc;\n    color: #6a6a60;\n    font-size: 9px;\n    letter-spacing: 2px;\n    writing-mode: vertical-rl;\n    text-align: center;\n    padding: 8px 0;\n    border: 1px solid #c0c0b5;\n  }\n  .menu-item {\n    height: 62px;\n    line-height: 62px;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    color: #ffffff;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.35);\n  }\n  .m1 { background: #cbcbc0; color: #7a7a70; }\n  .m2 { background: #b9b9ae; color: #6f6f65; }\n  .m3 { background: #a83f6a; }\n  .m4 { background: #b5b5aa; color: #6f6f65; }\n  .m5 { background: #dcdcd2; color: #9a9a90; }\n  .m6 { background: #a83f6a; }\n  .m7 { background: #b5b5aa; color: #6f6f65; }\n  .m8 { background: #a83f6a; }\n  .m9 { background: #b5b5aa; color: #6f6f65; }\n  /* footer watermark */\n  .footer {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"SimHei\", sans-serif;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    color: #4d4d46;\n    padding: 6px 0 0 0;\n  }\n  .footer .sub {\n    font-size: 10px;\n    color: #8a8a80;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <div class=\"topbar\">\n    <div class=\"page-num\">1</div>\n    <div class=\"top-placeholder placeholder\">[Banner area: blank, top centered]</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"columns\">\n\n    <div class=\"col-main\">\n      <p>Ketiga, di <span class=\"hl\">sesetengah</span> universiti sokongan dan bantuan <span class=\"hl\">berkaitan</span> kesihatan mental masih lagi <span class=\"hl\">berkurangan</span>.</p>\n\n      <p>Hal ini <span class=\"hl\">menyebabkan</span> ramai pelajar tidak mempunyai <span class=\"hl\">capaian</span> kepada bantuan kesihatan mental yang diperlukan dan ini sering menyebabkan masalah mereka menjadi <span class=\"hl\">semakin</span> teruk.</p>\n\n      <p>Bagaimanapun di <span class=\"hl\">sebalik</span> semua cabaran itu, kesedaran mengenai kesihatan mental perlu dibuat secara <span class=\"hl\">berterusan</span>. Masih terdapat banyak langkah yang boleh diambil untuk <span class=\"hl\">tujuan</span> itu.</p>\n\n      <p>Antaranya, IPT sendiri perlu <span class=\"hl\">program</span> berkaitan isu itu seperti <span class=\"hl\">bengkel</span> kemahiran menguruskan tekanan, <span class=\"hl\">ceramah</span> dan klinik kesihat an mental.</p>\n\n      <p style=\"margin-top:26px;\">Selain itu, pihak IPT perlu <span class=\"hl\">menyediakan</span> sokongan yang <span class=\"hl\">mencukupi</span> kepada pelajar, termasuk sokongan kewangan dan <span class=\"hl2\">sumber</span> bantuan kesihatan mental.</p>\n\n      <p>Keduanya, pelajar universiti perlu <span class=\"hl\">didedahkan</span> dengan pengetahuan mengenai kesihatan mental dan cara untuk menguruskan kesihatan mental mereka sendiri.</p>\n\n      <p>Selain itu, adalah penting untuk mengurangkan stigma dan <span class=\"hl\">diskriminasi</span> terhadap masalah kesihatan mental dalam <span class=\"hl\">kalangan</span> pelajar universiti di Malaysia.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"col-notes\">\n      <p>sesetengah 一部分<br>\n      berkaitan 关于<br>\n      berkurangan 缺少</p>\n\n      <p>menyebabkan 导致<br>\n      capaian 取得的东西<br>\n      semakin 越来越</p>\n\n      <p>sebalik 反面<br>\n      berterusan 持续<br>\n      tujuan 目的</p>\n\n      <p>program 项目<br>\n      bengkel 研讨会<br>\n      ceramah 演讲</p>\n\n      <p style=\"margin-top:26px;\">menyediakan 准备<br>\n      mencukupi 足够<br>\n      sumber 来源</p>\n\n      <p>didedahkan 被影响</p>\n\n      <p>diskriminasi 歧视<br>\n      kalangan 圈子</p>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"menu-strip\">\n    <div class=\"menu-tab\">MENU</div>\n    <div class=\"menu-item m1\">1</div>\n    <div class=\"menu-item m2\">2</div>\n    <div class=\"menu-item m3\">3</div>\n    <div class=\"menu-item m4\">4</div>\n    <div class=\"menu-item m5\">5</div>\n    <div class=\"menu-item m6\">6</div>\n    <div class=\"menu-item m7\">7</div>\n    <div class=\"menu-item m8\">8</div>\n    <div class=\"menu-item m9\">9</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"footer\">\n    （爱读书的芳）<br>\n    <span class=\"sub\">from [illegible]</span>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
